error: effect `println!` must stand on its own
 --> an_effect_in_a_block_on_the_right_of_an_and_stands_on_a_line_of_its_own.fn:6:15
  |
6 |     printed = host.println!("the right side ran")
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ on a line of a block inside an expression
